Enter a protective battle stance allowing you to defend yourself more proficiently while using a shield.

Increases Armour by [23, 30, 36, 40, 44 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)], Block value by [55, 71, 84, 94, 103 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)], and reduces Block cooldown by 2.

Increases stun and knockback resistance by [16%, 26%, 34%, 39%, 44% (TL1-5)].

The Armor and Block bonuses increase equally with your Dexterity and Strength.
